# RigTether component licensing

Copyright 2026 Robert Jackson

This repository is intentionally multi-licensed by component:

| Paths | License |
| --- | --- |
| `hardware/**` | CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 — Strongly Reciprocal (`CERN-OHL-S-2.0`) |
| `firmware/**`, `ios/**`, `protocol/**`, `tools/**`, `scripts/**`, `.github/**`, `.mise/**` | Apache License 2.0 (`Apache-2.0`) |
| `docs/**`, `README.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SUPPORT.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md`, `NOTICE` | Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (`CC-BY-4.0`) |
| `planning/**` | Apache License 2.0 (`Apache-2.0`) |

Files with an explicit SPDX header use the license named in that header. Third-party
files remain under their stated licenses.

Full license texts are in [`LICENSES/`](LICENSES/):

- `LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`
- `LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt`
- `LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt`

Hardware recipients must also receive the complete preferred-form design source and
notices required by CERN-OHL-S-2.0. Generated Gerbers, PDFs, STEP files, and firmware
binaries do not replace editable source.
